        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given that we have designed our platform to be easily deployed, our services typically do not involve implementation and are designed to facilitate a more rapid and successful deployment of MongoDB by our customers.",
        "start_character": 20797,
        "end_character": 21012
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016799",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016799-84dcd298ff9c2bce",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In October 2017, we completed our initial public offering and our common stock is listed on The Nasdaq Global Market (“Nasdaq”) under the symbol “MDB.” Our principal executive offices are located at 1633 Broadway, 38th Floor, New York, New York 10019 and our telephone number is (646) 727-4092.",
        "start_character": 51030,
        "end_character": 51324
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016799",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016799-84dcd298ff9c2bce",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our four working models - in office, flexible, remote and customer-facing remote - help ensure that we are meeting business needs while also offering employees flexibility.",
        "start_character": 37099,
        "end_character": 37271
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016799",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016799-84dcd298ff9c2bce",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our small development teams foster greater agility, which enables us to develop new, innovative products and make rapid changes to our infrastructure that increase resiliency and operational efficiency.We intend to continue to invest in our research and development capabilities to extend our platform.",
        "start_character": 44540,
        "end_character": 44842
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016799",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016799-84dcd298ff9c2bce",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also drive awareness through targeted marketing programs, such as our Reclaim the Bay initiative, our .Local user conferences, and other efforts to educate developers regarding the capabilities of our products.",
        "start_character": 24518,
        "end_character": 24731
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016799",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016799-84dcd298ff9c2bce",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the market for our offerings is large and growing.",
        "start_character": 7647,
        "end_character": 7708
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016799",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016799-84dcd298ff9c2bce",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We benefit from word-of-mouth awareness and frictionless experimentation by the developer community through our free offerings.",
        "start_character": 24390,
        "end_character": 24517
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016799",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016799-84dcd298ff9c2bce",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have attracted a large and growing community of highly engaged developers, who have downloaded our Community Server offering over 700 million times from our website since February 2009.",
        "start_character": 26648,
        "end_character": 26836
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-016799",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-016799-84dcd298ff9c2bce",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-016799",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have expanded our global partner ecosystem with Alibaba Cloud and Tencent Cloud to offer an authorized MongoDB-as-a-Service solution in China, allowing their customers to easily adopt and consume our hosted solution.",
